# THE BROADCAST'S RECORDING IS READ FROM DAY 1 (BUILD-1, 18 Nov; John 16:47 "1").
#
# Cobra Commander's broadcast (day 20-60) hands over STR_BROADCAST_RECORDING and says "Research: Trace the Broadcast". The
# recording sat in the COMMS lane, which needs a Comms Center, and the Day 1 Pit has none - so the topic never appeared and
# the lead to Cobra's first cell (STR_LEAD_COBRA_CELL: recording 40 + trace 60) went nowhere. The 60-day campaign run read
# everything else and never this. It is analysts' work on a tape: the INTEL lane, which runs from Day 1 (John 17 Nov 17:47).
# Every other COMMS topic keeps its room. STORY: say if you would rather the Comms Center came with the Pit instead.
research:
  - name: STR_BROADCAST_RECORDING
    lane: INTEL
